---
interface Props { lang?: 'de' | 'en'; }
const { lang = 'de' } = Astro.props;
const isEn = lang === 'en';
---
<section class="section roadmap-section" id="roadmap">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <span class="section-label">{isEn ? 'Version 3.0' : 'Version 3.0'}</span>
      <h2>{isEn ? 'What the new version can do' : 'Was die neue Version kann'}</h2>
      <p>
        {isEn ? 'AUSTR.AI 3.0 brings free browser choice, real Ctrl+C control, automatic update checks, and cross-platform stability on Windows, macOS and Linux — on top of all the privacy features from 2.x.' : 'AUSTR.AI 3.0 bringt freie Browserwahl, echte Ctrl+C-Kontrolle, automatischen Update-Check und stabile Ausführung auf Windows, macOS und Linux — zusätzlich zu allen Datenschutz-Features aus 2.x.'}
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="roadmap-grid">
      <div class="roadmap-card roadmap-card-new">
        <div class="roadmap-badge">{isEn ? 'New' : 'Neu'}</div>
        <div class="roadmap-icon">
          <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
            <path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/>
            <path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>{isEn ? '4 Protection Levels' : '4 Schutzklassen'}</h3>
        <p>{isEn ? 'Every recognised piece of data is automatically classified into one of four protection tiers — Public, Internal, Confidential and Restricted. Restricted entries additionally expire after only five minutes inside the encrypted vault, so that highly sensitive mappings cannot persist longer than necessary.' : 'Jeder erkannte Datenpunkt wird automatisch in eine von vier Schutzklassen eingeordnet — öffentlich, intern, vertraulich und streng vertraulich. Streng vertrauliche Einträge verfallen zusätzlich bereits nach fünf Minuten im verschlüsselten Vault, damit besonders sensible Zuordnungen nicht länger als nötig vorgehalten werden.'}</p>
      </div>

      <div class="roadmap-card roadmap-card-new">
        <div class="roadmap-badge">{isEn ? 'New' : 'Neu'}</div>
        <div class="roadmap-icon">
          <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
            <polyline points="16 18 22 12 16 6"/>
            <polyline points="8 6 2 12 8 18"/>
            <line x1="14" y1="4" x2="10" y2="20"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>{isEn ? 'Semantic Codes' : 'Semantische Codes'}</h3>
        <p>{isEn ? 'Instead of generic placeholders, anonymised entities are labelled by their actual type — for example [DATE_OF_BIRTH_1], [MEDICAL_CONDITION_1] or [AT_SVNR_1]. The AI model therefore understands what kind of information is being referenced and never confuses a birth date with a bank account.' : 'Statt generischer Platzhalter werden anonymisierte Begriffe nach ihrem tatsächlichen Typ benannt — zum Beispiel [DATE_OF_BIRTH_1], [MEDICAL_CONDITION_1] oder [AT_SVNR_1]. Das KI-Modell erkennt dadurch, um welche Art von Information es sich handelt, und verwechselt ein Geburtsdatum nicht mit einer Kontonummer.'}</p>
      </div>

      <div class="roadmap-card roadmap-card-new">
        <div class="roadmap-badge">{isEn ? 'New' : 'Neu'}</div>
        <div class="roadmap-icon">
          <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
            <rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2" ry="2"/>
            <path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0110 0v4"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>{isEn ? 'Security Hardening' : 'Maximale Sicherheit'}</h3>
        <p>{isEn ? 'The entire conversation history is re-anonymised before each message is sent to an AI provider. If an error occurs during processing, the request is blocked rather than silently forwarded. Logs never contain personal data, cross-origin requests are restricted and the encrypted vault keeps a full audit trail of every access.' : 'Der gesamte Gesprächsverlauf wird vor jedem einzelnen Senden an einen KI-Anbieter erneut anonymisiert. Sollte bei der Verarbeitung ein Fehler auftreten, wird die Anfrage blockiert statt stillschweigend weitergereicht. Protokolle enthalten zu keinem Zeitpunkt personenbezogene Daten, Cross-Origin-Zugriffe sind beschränkt, und der verschlüsselte Vault protokolliert jeden Zugriff lückenlos.'}</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Future vision -->
    <div class="roadmap-future">
      <span class="roadmap-future-label">{isEn ? 'In planning' : 'In Planung'}</span>
      <span class="roadmap-future-text">{isEn ? 'A browser extension that anonymises data directly inside ChatGPT, Claude and Gemini.' : 'Eine Browser-Erweiterung, die Daten direkt in ChatGPT, Claude und Gemini anonymisiert.'}</span>
      <span class="roadmap-future-divider">|</span>
      <span class="roadmap-future-text">{isEn ? 'A dedicated iOS app to use AUSTR.AI comfortably on your phone.' : 'Eine eigene iOS-App, um AUSTR.AI bequem am Handy zu nutzen.'}</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .roadmap-section {
    position: relative;
    background: var(--color-bg-alt);
  }

  .roadmap-section::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    height: 1px;
    background: linear-gradient(to right, transparent, var(--color-border), transparent);
  }

  .roadmap-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .roadmap-card {
    background: var(--color-bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: 2rem;
    transition: all var(--transition-base);
    position: relative;
  }

  .roadmap-card:hover {
    border-color: var(--color-border-light);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
  }

  .roadmap-card-experimental {
    border-color: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.3);
  }

  .roadmap-card-planned {
    border-color: rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.2);
  }

  .roadmap-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 0.6875rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    padding: 2px 8px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .roadmap-card-new {
    border-color: rgba(13, 148, 136, 0.3);
  }

  .roadmap-card-new .roadmap-badge {
    color: var(--color-accent);
    background: rgba(13, 148, 136, 0.1);
  }

  .roadmap-card-new .roadmap-icon {
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .roadmap-card-experimental .roadmap-badge {
    color: #F59E0B;
    background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.1);
  }

  .roadmap-card-planned .roadmap-badge {
    color: var(--color-accent-purple);
    background: rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.1);
  }

  .roadmap-icon {
    color: var(--color-text-dim);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .roadmap-card-experimental .roadmap-icon {
    color: #F59E0B;
  }

  .roadmap-card-planned .roadmap-icon {
    color: var(--color-accent-purple);
  }

  .roadmap-card h3 {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .roadmap-card p {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .roadmap-future {
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    gap: 0.75rem; flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-top: 2rem; padding: 1rem 1.5rem;
    background: var(--color-bg-card);
    border: 1px dashed var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    font-size: 0.875rem; color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }
  .roadmap-future-label {
    font-weight: 600; color: var(--color-accent-purple);
    font-size: 0.75rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  }
  .roadmap-future-divider { color: var(--color-border); }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .roadmap-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .roadmap-future { flex-direction: column; text-align: center; }
    .roadmap-future-divider { display: none; }
  }
</style>